el link\n\n\nDownload this file: [NetaYumev35_pretrained_all_in_one.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/duongve/NetaYume-Lumina-Image-2.0/resolve/main/NetaYumev35_pretrained_all_in_one.safetensors) \n\nThen place it in the **ComfyUI/models/checkpoints** folder."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: About NetaYume Lumina", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [420, 690.796875], "pos": [353.8619689941406, 154.25962829589844], "id": 16, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["This model is best at 1024x1024, but you can try higher like 1024x1536"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Image size", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [340, 112], "pos": [362.35211181640625, 899.7603149414062], "id": 17, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["You should keep the prefix part fixed until the **Prompt Start** tag\n\n@whatever in the prompt is for artist tags, such as @comfyanonymous\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [440, 210], "pos": [330.1636962890625, -115.60723876953125], "id": 18, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [58], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [388.23956298828125, 129.0459747314453], "pos": [1652.2874755859375, 512.3340454101562], "widgets_values": ["blurry, worst quality, low quality, jpeg artifacts, signature, watermark, username, error, deformed hands, bad anatomy, extra